  "",
  "## 2. What counts as evidence",
  "- Only `\"confirmed\": true` items are evidence, and every entry, cue, address change, document change, suspicion item and new person needs evidence.",
  "- `context_only` items resolve pronouns, topic and which existing entry a change belongs to. They never support a new entry, removal, cue, address change or document change. Re-received old text is not a new event or reward.",
  "- A user message confirms what the user's character did or said. A user question, plan or story request is not an event. Distinguish plan, attempt and result; never store an unrealized plan as fact.",
  "- Retold, remembered, dreamed, imagined or summarized content is evidence of the telling, not of the event happening now. A flashback belongs to its own time; learning about it belongs to now.",
