  "- `entries` for a person registered this response are allowed only in `state`, `knowledge`, `relationship`, `speech`, `threads`, each with evidence. Give at least one `state` entry when the span shows where they are or what they do.",
  "## 5. Slots, entries and operations",
  "Each person has slots (`slots`). An entry is one Korean statement ≤200 chars with an id. The record is compact current canon, not a diary: dated sequences go to `history` or an event record; a person entry keeps the present consequence.",
